{"allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "structure morphism", "target_term": "结构态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "group scheme", "target_term": "群概形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为一个代数叠（algebraic stack）的呈示。那么，<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>上的对角的性质，就是态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>的性质。例如，若<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>上代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的某个光滑（smooth）群（group），则<MATH_0008>就是结构态射（structure morphism）<MATH_0009>。因此，对角本身并不自动是分离（separated）的（这与概形（schemes）和代数空间（algebraic spaces）的情形相反）。说<MATH_0010>在<MATH_0011>上是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，当然应当蕴含<MATH_0012>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，但说<MATH_0013>在<MATH_0014>上是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，若不同时要求态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，我们就有所犹豫。换言之，要求对角态射（morphism）是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，并不真正符合我们对“拟分离（quasi-separated）代数叠（algebraic stack）”的直觉，我们还应当要求对角本身是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n那么，“分离（separated）代数叠（algebraic stacks）”又如何呢？我们已经在《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0001>中看到，一个代数空间（algebraic space）是分离（separated）的，当且仅当其对角是固有（proper）的。这也是通常用来定义分离（separated）代数叠（algebraic stacks）的条件。在上面的例子<MATH_0016>中，这意味着<MATH_0017>是一个固有（proper）群概形（group scheme）。这意味着，形如<MATH_0018>的代数叠（algebraic stacks）在<MATH_0019>上是固有（proper）的，其中<MATH_0020>是<MATH_0021>上的一条椭圆曲线（此处待插入后续引用）。在某些情形下，假设对角是有限（finite）的可能更为自然。\n\n", "unit_id": "tag:04YV:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "呈示及拟分离性的讨论", "source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "对角及呈示的态射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "群及分离性的比较", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "群的光滑性", "source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"context": "代数空间中的群", "source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"context": "群到基底的态射", "source_term": "structure morphism", "target_term": "结构态射"}, {"context": "对角及叠的分离性", "source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"context": "与概形情形比较", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "叠与对角的拟分离性", "source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"context": "对角的拟紧性", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"context": "分离叠及例子", "source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "所引用章节标题", "source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "分离性与对角固有性的等价", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "对角、群与叠的固有性", "source_term": "proper", "targe