{"allowed_english": ["Deligne-Mumford"], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "DM", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "DM", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "DM", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "DM", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "Deligne-Mumford stack", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德叠"}, {"source_term": "DM", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Deligne-Mumford stacks", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德叠"}, {"source_term": "quasi-DM", "target_term": "拟德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"source_term": "quasi-DM", "target_term": "拟德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-DM", "target_term": "拟德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "quasi-DM", "target_term": "拟德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限呈示"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}], "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为代数叠（algebraic stacks）之间的一个态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>德利涅–芒福德型（DM）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若<MATH_0003>是非分歧的<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>德利涅–芒福德型（DM）这一缩写代表 Deligne-Mumford。若<MATH_0004>是德利涅–芒福德型（DM）的，则给定任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>和任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>上的一个代数叠（algebraic stack），其对角是非分歧的，即<MATH_0009>是德利涅–芒福德型（DM）的。这蕴含<MATH_0010>是一个德利涅–芒福德叠（Deligne-Mumford stack），见定理<REF_0001>。换言之，德利涅–芒福德型（DM）态射（morphism）就是其“纤维”为德利涅–芒福德叠（Deligne-Mumford stacks）的态射。希望这至少能说明这一术语的动机。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0011>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>拟德利涅–芒福德型（quasi-DM）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若<MATH_0012>是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0002>若<MATH_0013>是拟德利涅–芒福德型（quasi-DM）的，则“纤维”<MATH_0014>（属于<MATH_0015>）是拟德利涅–芒福德型（quasi-DM）的。一个代数叠（algebraic stack）<MATH_0016>是拟德利涅–芒福德型（quasi-DM）的，当且仅当存在一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0017>以及一个满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、有限呈示（finite presentation）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0018>，它是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的，见定理<REF_0002>。注意，这与 Deligne-Mumford 性质相似，后者是通过具有平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）来定义的，该覆盖由一个概形（scheme）给出。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 称<MATH_0019>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>分离（separated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>的，若<MATH_0020>是固有（proper）的。\n<STRUCT_0005> 称<MATH_0021>为<TEXTITOPEN_0004>拟分离（quasi-separated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>的，若<MATH_0022>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "unit_id": "tag:04YW:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所定义态射的两端", "source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "分离公理所约束的映射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "以对角非分歧为条件的性质及缩写", "source_term": "DM", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"context": "基变换与覆盖的概形", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "脚注中的基变换", "source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"context": "基变换所得的叠", "source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "脚注引用定理中的叠", "source_term": "Deligne-Mumford stack", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德叠"}, {"context": "态射的纤维", "source_term": "Deligne-Mumford stacks", "target_term": "德利涅–芒福德叠"}, {"context": "以对角局部拟有限为条件的性质", "source_term": "quasi-DM", "target_term": "拟德利涅–芒福德型"}, {"context": "对角及覆盖态射的性质", "source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"context": "覆盖态射的满射性", "source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"context": "覆盖态射的平坦性", "source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"context": "覆盖态射的呈示条件", "source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限呈示"}, {"context": "概形给出的覆盖的性质", "source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "Deligne-Mumford 性质的定义", "source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"context": "对角固有的定义", "source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"context": "分离性对对角的要求", "source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"context": "对角拟紧且拟分离的定义", "source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"context": "对角的紧性条件", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}]}
